 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 3.162,
   "end": 7.442,
   "text": "Firon answers: \"To prove to you that I am on your side,"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.562,
   "end": 12.322,
   "text": "I will give you a key whose purpose will surely be explained to you later."
  },
  {
   "start": 12.379,
   "end": 18.242,
   "text": "Unfortunately it is not within my power to tell you myself, but there is someone..."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.293,
   "end": 21.123,
   "text": "someone in the old monastery on the hill in the"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.186,
   "end": 23.843,
   "text": "northeast of the country whom you should find."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.162,
   "end": 27.683,
   "text": "We were both members of a circle that secretly dealt with the"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.736,
   "end": 31.522,
   "text": "problems of this country after evil had gained the upper hand."
  },
  {
   "start": 31.763,
   "end": 33.843,
   "text": "Sadly...\""
  },
  {
   "start": 33.898,
   "end": 37.683,
   "text": "- at these words he sighs and, for a short moment,"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.736,
   "end": 42.002,
   "text": "looks absent-mindedly past you into the cold emptiness -"
  },
  {
   "start": 42.082,
   "end": 46.722,
   "text": "\"Sadly, he did not manage to flee to us in this wasteland,"
  },
  {
   "start": 46.763,
   "end": 51.123,
   "text": "and so he fell into the hands of evil's henchmen..."
  },
  {
   "start": 51.203,
   "end": 54.082,
   "text": "I never saw him again, nor the monastery that"
  },
  {
   "start": 54.151,
   "end": 57.763,
   "text": "served us as our secret headquarters back then:"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.822,
   "end": 60.082,
   "text": "all that remained to me was a key,"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.123,
   "end": 64.922,
   "text": "whose imprint I cast in magic ice and have kept for decades."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.052,
   "end": 68.002,
   "text": "May it help you on your quest...\""
  },
  {
   "start": 68.05,
   "end": 72.722,
   "text": "With these words, Firon rises, takes a large key from a secret"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.769,
   "end": 78.002,
   "text": "compartment in his throne and carefully places it in your outstretched hand."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.681,
   "end": 83.364,
   "text": "With a look at the portal behind you, he adds: \"My guards will let you pass."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.804,
   "end": 87.204,
   "text": "I will order them to prepare one of my fastest badger"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.285,
   "end": 90.404,
   "text": "sleds for your return to the edge of the ice regions."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.644,
   "end": 95.605,
   "text": "Farewell, my friend - and may the gods protect you...\""
  },
  {
   "start": 95.636,
   "end": 100.005,
   "text": "With these words, Firon beckons the yeti, who leads you outside,"
  },
  {
   "start": 100.017,
   "end": 103.684,
   "text": "where Firon's sled is already waiting for you..."
  }
 ]
}
